  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara range la maison avec Noy et lit les étiquettes.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ນີ້ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Nȉi mɛ̄ɛn nyǎng?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ນີ້ແມ່ນຈານ</span><span class=\"rom\">Nȉi mɛ̄ɛn jǎan.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ແລ້ວນັ້ນເດ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Lɛ̏ɛw nȁn dě?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ນັ້ນແມ່ນກາເຟ</span><span class=\"rom\">Nȁn mɛ̄ɛn kǎa-féé.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ອ່ານໄດ້ເກັ່ງເນາະ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Àan dâay kèng nɔ̄!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ດີແທ້! ຂ້ອຍອ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ</span><span class=\"rom\">Dǐi thɛ̏ɛ! Khɔ̂ɔy àan dâay lɛ̏ɛw.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Noy</b> — C&#x27;est quoi, ça ?<br><b>Clara</b> — C&#x27;est une assiette.<br><b>Noy</b> — Et ça ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Ça, c&#x27;est du café.<br><b>Noy</b> — Tu lis bien, dis donc !<br><b>Clara</b> — Super ! Je sais lire maintenant.</p></details>"
